  m_Text: "Even nuclear fuel is not endless. The amount of fuel is displayed on this scale. The less fuel, the less heat is produced by the nuclear fuel rods. To replace them, go to the Upgrade's menu and buy \"Nuclear fuel recharge\"\r\nAttention! Recharging of nuclear fuel increases the radiation level!\r\n"
